          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On May 28, 1978, around 9:00 AM, a witness observed in the direction of the rising sun a set of halos of different colors from which radiant light seemed to emanate. The observation lasted between 6 to 10 minutes before the phenomenon disappeared. No other reports of this phenomenon were collected. This person likely observed a lenticular cloud.",
